inline_glob_in_backticks {
    Package filters use `@reqlan/*` in CI. The slash-star stays inline code, not a block comment.
    Recursive globs use `/**/` in paths such as `../mod/**/*.rq`.
    A real line comment may follow. // this is a real line comment
    After that, [live_after_inline_glob] must still parse.
}

live_after_inline_glob {
    This idea must remain visible after the inline glob examples.
}
